Use SOM CNL version 1.
Use prompt version 3.
Use package tickets.
Begin resource.
Use resource name Ticket.
Use table tickets.
Use path "/tickets".
Field subject is required str and is unique.
Field code is required int and is unique.
Field priority is required int and is not unique.
Field estimate is optional float and is not unique with default null.
Field note is optional str and is not unique with default null.
Field closed is optional bool and is not unique with default false.
End resource.
Begin query.
Filter exactly on field closed.
Limit query results to 50.
End query.
Use migration revision cov3000.
Use no previous migration revision.
Begin routes.
Create a row. Return 409 for a unique value conflict.
Delete a row. Return 404 if it does not exist.
List rows with an optional exact boolean filter, limit, and offset in id order.
Update supplied fields. Return 404 if the row does not exist.
Get a row by id. Return 404 if it does not exist.
End routes.
Begin checks.
Check standalone CRUD, boolean filtering, page bounds, defaults, timestamps, missing id, and migration.
End checks.
End request.
